          "speaker": "Learner",
          "text": "I'm looking for a place that serves Spanish food somewhere in town."
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Assistant",
          "text": "There are two Spanish restaurants, both in the centre. La Raza is cheap, while La Tasca is moderately priced."
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Learner",
          "text": "I don't have a preference. Which one would you suggest?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Assistant",
          "text": "La Raza is a cheap Spanish restaurant in the centre. Would you like more information about it?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Learner",
          "text": "Actually, I'll go with La Tasca. What is its phone number?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Assistant",
          "text": "La Tasca's phone number is 01223 464630."
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Learner",
          "text": "Thank you. Goodbye."
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Assistant",
          "text": "You're welcome. Goodbye."
